{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And YHWH went.</b> Abraham waited there and did not attain the fullness of his prophetic intent until the Shekhinah withdrew — the opposite of וַיֵּצֵא קַיִן מִלִּפְנֵי ה׳ (Genesis 4:16)." "<b>And Abraham returned.</b> He returned from the place where the angels had escorted him, for there the prophetic communication had been conferred upon him." "<b>To his place.</b> To his home."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:42.654169637Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}